# Ambush Wolf has flash (CR 702.8a), so Bot1 casts it at Bot2's end step; its enters trigger exiles the Black Lotus Bot2 sacrificed from Bot2's
# graveyard (CR 115.1, 701.13a) and the Wolf itself stays on the battlefield as a 4/2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Ambush Wolf
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Island x20

